    title: "Dice Puzzle",
    description: Some("Sixteen dice fill the screen and every one must be turned up to six: a cursor slides along the grid\'s edge, and firing bumps each die in the facing row or diagonal by one. The board starts all ones, is always solvable, and the game times you — a warning chimes every five minutes up to an hour — before reporting your time and turn count."),
